WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.600
Wow, that looks really delicious!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.870
Doesn't it?

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:08.140
Last year, I made a sachertorte for Onii-chan!

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.520
And a chocolate cake the year before...

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.340
And a chocolate blackmange the year before that!

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.320
What should I make this year?

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.420
Koyoi-chan, you're amazing.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.280
Okay! This year I'm going to make handmade chocolate!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.600
Really? What are you going to make?

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.050
It's a secret.

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.910
You say that, but are you really going to make some?

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.440
H-How rude!

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.670
Psh, the hell with Valentine's Day.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.960
Plus, I've only received chocolate from my mom!

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:37.520
Well, you don't know what could happen this year, Kusuda-kun.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.690
Maybe you'll get some from Enomoto-san.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.280
Don't joke around like that!

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:51.300
More importantly, if my predictions are correct, Arihara Ayumi is going to give you chocolate!

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.830
The person I really want chocolate from is...

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.030
Here, Mamoru.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.120
Chocolate.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:06.440
Don't eat them all yourself; be sure to give Misao half.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.550
Saki-nee...

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.970
It is too much after all.

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:18.730
It would be okay if they both feel the same way,

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:20.340
but making unrequited chocolate is a bit...

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.890
A-As long as there are feelings put into making them, I wouldn't mind, but...

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:28.440
Well, you'd feel more relieved than anything...

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.330
Feel relieved, huh...

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:34.520
Girls always give chocolates with their true feelings,

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:36.590
but don't guys just worry about how many they get?

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:38.600
Not just how many, but...

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:39.470
Hey!

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.160
What does Valentine's Day mean to a guy?

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.450
G-Good question...

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:52.830
To me, it's the day where you find out who likes whom... I guess?

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.420
Arihara doesn't have anyone he likes right now, right?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:03.610
No...

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.580
My tongue is going numb!

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:10.470
What did you mix in to make them taste so bad?

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:11.840
You're terrible!

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:15.230
Zaitsu-kun's so nice that he'd definitely eat them without leaving any behind!

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:22.650
Your handmade chocolates are delicious...

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.370
Onii-chan, you're so nice.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.080
Then pet my hai-

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.490
No!

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.430
You really do have a bad sense of humor.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.360
I guess I really should give Arihara chocolate.

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:43.470
I don't think giving chocolate on Valentine's is meaningless.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:49.820
But if you don't give him chocolate, he won't know your true feelings...

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:50.890
On February 14th, chocolate holds many meanings...

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.310
like a love letter expressing one's true feelings...

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:57.550
or assurance to continue a good life...

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.710
To me, I think...

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:07.490
that chocolate is a sweet...

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.640
bomb.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:45.930
The Melancholy of the Chocolate Bomber

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.930
Look, look! It says it's a "chocolate bomb."

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.760
"The inside is a surprise, so it's fun."

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.430
It sounds like a punishment.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.890
Should we make this our obligatory chocolate?

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.600
Really? I don't know...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:55.560
It's okay! It's interesting since it's obligatory, and the contents don't matter!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.610
Get the Best Chocolate for that Special Person

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.270
You're right. It might be interesting.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.780
That special someone...

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.740
I bought it...

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:14.370
I can't believe that I fell victim to the chocolate companies' marketing ploys...

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.420
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.960
Ah, wai-

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.970
What was that?! Ow.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.220
Saki-nee!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:27.720
Mamoru.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.590
What happened?

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.510
Are you okay?

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.100
Someone ran into me all of a sudden...

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.270
Gosh...

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.520
I hope none of them are damaged.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.400
Saki-nee, that's...

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.360
Oh, these?

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.990
These are special chocolates.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.320
They're expensive!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:52.990
I splurged on these, so I might not have any for you this year.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.120
Just kidding!

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.370
I'll make sure to buy some for you too.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.960
What's wrong? You don't look well.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.090
Did you catch a cold?

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.720
That's not good since you catch them easily.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.840
Wear your scarf properly.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.890
Saki-nee, is there someone you like?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:12.810
Kind of.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:22.900
I'm younger than you and I catch colds easily. I guess I'll never be able to receive something like that.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.740
What're you talking about? Considering you get so many chocolates every year.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.280
Okay, all done.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.070
I...

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:34.240
As long as I get chocolates from Saki-nee ГўВЂВ“ from Yamamoto Misaki ГўВЂВ“ I'd...

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.330
There's a store I want to stop by, so...

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:39.870
Mamoru!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.800
But Mamoru is my childhood friend,

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.380
and I've never thought of him that way...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.720
Mamoru...

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.220
I'm home.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.600
Welcome back.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.600
You look depressed.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.190
Something happen?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:03.230
Saki-nee said we might not get chocolate from her this year.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.230
That so?

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:08.240
But if I can get some from Ayumi-chan, then...

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.910
I bet she makes her own chocolate.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.990
I bet they're delicious!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.000
Ayumi!

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.590
Saki-nee...

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:34.600
Troubled again?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:36.930
Oh, Bessho-kun.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.890
I can listen if you want.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.270
After school then.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:44.060
Okay, I'll be waiting in the classroom.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.610
Hey, Yamamoto-san...

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.280
You and Bessho-kun seem to have gotten quite friendly recently.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.910
Friendly? All I've been doing is asking him for advice.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.990
But being alone together after school is pretty suspicious!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.450
Stop thinking of such weird things.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.750
We aren't like that.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.460
But what about Bessho-kun?

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.130
Huh?

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:08.000
Bessho-kun might like you.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.920
Yeah, right...

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:16.470
Then let's test it out by having you go home right after school.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:21.640
If he really likes you, he'll wait forever.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.320
What?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.910
Here. Take this if you want.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:41.950
Huh?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.870
It's a token of my appreciation for listening to me.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:47.330
Really, thanks for always listening, Bessho-kun.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.510
What am I doing?

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:07.310
School is now over. Remaining students, please return home promptly.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.610
Bessho-kun, I'm sorry.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:12.530
School is now over. Remaining students, please return home promptly.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.700
To me, chocolate is a sweet bomb.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:24.210
I had just planned to throw them into Arihara's heart, and light a fire within him.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:35.550
But if both Bessho-kun and Mamoru really do like me, then what kind of meaning will this chocolate have?

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:43.520
Am I still going to give this bomb to Arihara?

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.980
Onii-chan, what do you want this year?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:49.940
Chocolate daifuku?

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:50.900
Chocolate bananas?

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.610
Or how about chocolate-covered lobster?

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.530
Onii-chan!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.240
Huh?

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.660
Oh, um...

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:02.080
Anything but the lobster is fine.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.450
I'm going to go take a bath.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.000
Onii-chan... How weird.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.330
I wonder what's wrong?

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.890
Maybe it's related to the Demon Lord?!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:30.600
If you don't hurry up and say, "Ahhn~," the chocolate will melt!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.690
No!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.610
That's foul play!

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:44.580
I've decided what chocolate I'm going to give Onii-chan.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:50.710
A super, giant, chocolate wedding cake!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:54.210
To think that her brother complex would deveop this far...

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.670
It's a horror.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.930
Koyoi-chan...

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:02.510
Gah...

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.430
Ayumi, what's wrong?

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.220
You've been depressed since yesterday.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.150
Koyoi-chan!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:14.690
If it's you, you might understand!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:18.320
You're in the same situation as me!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.450
I was thinking, but...

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:27.790
I'd be glad to accept chocolate from girls who have no one to give chocolate to.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:31.670
It's boring for girls if they don't have anyone to give anything to, right?

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:38.340
Kusuda-kun, it's not about the...

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:37.340
Enomoto, if you don't have anyone to give chocolate to, I'll take them.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:40.090
A-Are you stupid?

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.970
You think I have chocolates to give you?!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.010
Kappa-face!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.550
W-What?! You wrinkly-face!

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:52.600
Zaitsu-kun has someone he likes?!

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:53.900
Yeah.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.980
I saw them.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.400
If it's that bad, Zaitsu-kun will hate me.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.780
This time, I'll...

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:05.820
...I guess I'll never be able to recieve something like that.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.240
What're you talking about?

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.410
You get so many every year.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:09.790
Zaitsu-kun!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:16.290
As long as I get chocolates from Saki-nee ГўВЂВ“ from Yamamoto Misaki ГўВЂВ“ I'd...

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:23.760
Although she didn't seem feel the same way, she was really pretty...

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:29.430
Zaitsu-kun really likes this Yamamoto Misaki person.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.390
What?!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.650
Zaitsu-kun likes the Demon Lord?!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.270
Koyoi-chan?

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:41.690
My brother likes the Demon L- I mean, Yamamoto-san, too!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:42.900
Really?!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.070
Luckily, it's only one-sided on my brother's part.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.080
What about Yamamoto-san then?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.500
The one that the Demon Lord likes is your brother!

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.460
What?!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.920
What the heck are you guys doing?

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:13.730
Whisper   Whisper   Whisper

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:03.050
Basically, everything will be okay if the Demon Lord goes out with your brother.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:06.090
Then both of them will give up the Demon Lord.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.720
I see, but how?

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.730
It's like they have an invisible barrier up...

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:17.810
So everything will be all right if the Demon Lord gives my brother chocolate.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:22.030
It would be pointless if she isn't absolutely certain about giving them to him.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.490
Then we'll...

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.360
Yes, we'll help the Demon Lord with...

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.580
lighting the fuse in her heart!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.500
Sorry about yesterday.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.710
I suddenly remembered I had something to do...

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.590
I immediately went home, too, so don't worry about it.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.590
What's wrong?

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:51.930
No, nothing. See ya.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.060
I shouldn't depend on Bessho-kun anymore.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:03.610
I'll also throw away the chocolate so it'll be like I never bought them.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:08.990
I mean, I was given a lollipop,

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.330
then my heart started pounding...

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.790
So that's why I like him?

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.160
What's with that?

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.460
Ah, it's all becoming really bothersome now!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.170
I don't think love is for me.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.300
Yamamoto-san!

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.220
Sorry to stop you so suddenly, but...

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.880
you're Yamamoto Misaki-san, right?

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.300
Y-Yeah...

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.470
Koyoi-chan?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:36.390
She found out!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.730
We have a request for you, Yamamoto-san.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.650
Request?

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.150
Oni- No, I mean...

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:48.900
We want you to give chocolate to Arihara Yuuji!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.410
How do you know about that?

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.830
I was evesdropping...

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.330
Anyway, that's what we would like, so please do your best.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:57.250
Let's go.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.370
Sorry, but I decided not to give him chocolate.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.040
Why?

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.170
I can't see it.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.840
I can't see why I like him.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:14.260
And is it really okay to say, "I like you" to Arihara in this situation?

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.930
So I've already decided that I wouldn't give them to him.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.180
Bye.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.810
If you like him, then isn't that enough?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.940
After all, when I see Zaitsu-kun, my heart pounds,

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:32.070
but it's not pounding because he's good looking or nice.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.700
I think it pounds because I like him!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.200
If that's so, then I don't need a reason!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.080
If your heart pounds, then isn't that already love?

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.970
If your heart pounds, then love is love.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.810
I just have to be more honest, don't I?

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:01.310
Then I guess I'll have to try giving it my best!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:03.690
Yes!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.610
Thanks, both of you.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.860
Now the Demon Lord just has to to give him the chocolate!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.450
If we just show that to Onii-chan and Zaitsu-kun...

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.120
Onii-chan will be mine!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.120
Zaitsu-kun will be mine!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.210
All right.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.630
What? Tomorrow?

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.760
That's fine...

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.760
The riverbed next to Ajisai Bridge at five o'clock?

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.850
Make sure you come.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.980
There's something I want to give you.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:42.430
Wha-

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.060
See you.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.230
Something to giv-

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.560
Hey, Yamamoto!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.570
What was that?

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.200
Isn't tomorrow Valentine's Day?!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.280
S-Seriously?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.630
Today, everything will become clear...

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.760
Either if it's the end,

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.010
or if it's the beginning.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:21.350
At five o'clock this evening, I'll be waiting by Ajisai Bridge.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.140
Arihara-san...

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:29.770
Come on, Onii-chan! Hurry up!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.530
What's going on, Koyoi?

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.820
Why did you suddenly want to go for a walk?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.650
It's okay, just come!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:38.950
What? Why did you bring me all the way here?

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.660
You finally decided to give me some obligatory chocolate?

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.120
Yeah, right.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:44.830
That is right.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.620
Huh?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.960
I'm giving you obligatory chocolate.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:51.090
Since I've relied on you a lot.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.420
Um...

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.840
T-Thanks.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.760
W-Wait!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:04.100
This is different from the one I bought...

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.020
Why?

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.310
Was it that time?

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.860
If I remember correctly, she's in my sister's class...

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.780
What was I anticipating?

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:27.040
Kusuda, I'll give it to you later for sure, so wait!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.790
Seriously?

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.420
I'm so nervous!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.840
Will Zaitsu-kun really come?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.930
Yeah, the girl in your class that has big boobs and good style.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.720
She's like a cool beauty.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.100
What, her name's Yamamoto Misaki?

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.850
Where is she right now?

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.850
Yamamoto Misaki?

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:52.060
I ran into her earlier, and I think we switched chocolates.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:55.440
It would be bad if those were given to someone else!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.110
What do you mean by "bad?"

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:57.860
Ayumi?

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.280
Hey, what do you mean?

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.530
In any case, it's just bad.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.200
It would be the worst if they were given to someone.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.950
Was it a chocolate bomb or something?

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:06.790
This is bad!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.290
Where are you going, Ayumi?

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.170
To where Yamamoto Misaki is, of course.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.380
You know where she is?

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.300
In front of you!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.680
H-Hey, Ayumi-chan...

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.430
U-Um...

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.060
I'm not expecting chocolate at all or anything...

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:28.270
Chocolate...

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.810
You're fast at running, right?

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:31.940
Uh...

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:35.230
Here's chocolate that I made!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.740
If you run at top speed to the river bank, I'll give you all of them!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:51.710
Hey.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.130
Hey...

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.390
Why are they both here?

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.730
But I have to do this no matter what...

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:22.110
Arihara, this is...

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:27.120
Hold it with that chocolate!

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.700
Chocolate Bomb: Judgment!

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:30.160
What?

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.930
It wasn't a chocolate bomb?

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.430
Are you all right, Yamamoto?

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:54.560
Sorry, I just lost all my anxiety.

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:58.860
How weird...

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.860
I felt like I had to give them to you so badly,

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.320
but now that the chocolate is gone, I feel relieved.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.160
Bessho-kun. Mamoru.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:19.040
I'm sorry for everything up until now.

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.130
Koyoi, we're going home.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.640
Wait, Onii-chan!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:36.650
Huh? Arihara made faces like this?

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:39.360
What are you doing? Staring at someone's face...

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.280
I never really looked at you properly until now.

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:47.450
All right!

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.780
First, let's be friends.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:56.870
Y-Yeah...

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:06.090
And that's how the curtain closed on my life's first, real Valentine's Day.

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:14.560
Have you ever fallen in love?

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:29.780
{title: Those Memories in Full Bloom}

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:50.110
After the Renjo-senpai I had admired looked at my art,

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:54.370
the time I've spent with him has become my treasure.

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:59.080
But Senpai is always looking far off into the distance, so there's no space for me.
